        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>China Daily - Vocabulary Notes</title>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 8px 10px 20px 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  /* Masthead */\n  .masthead {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin: 4px 0 2px 6px;\n  }\n  .masthead .china { color: #111; }\n  .masthead .daily { color: #1a5fa8; }\n  .logo-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 6px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  .logo-cn {\n    color: #b02418;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-right: 10px;\n  }\n  .logo-url {\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    padding: 1px 6px;\n    color: #777;\n    font-size: 7px;\n  }\n\n  /* Two column boxed passage */\n  .passage {\n    display: flex;\n    border: 1px solid #4a7ebb;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .passage .col-en {\n    flex: 0 0 63%;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #4a7ebb;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    text-align: justify;\n    text-justify: inter-word;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 2;\n    color: #1f3d6e;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n  }\n  .passage .col-cn {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #1f3d6e;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .kw { color: #d1603d; }\n\n  /* Entries */\n  .entries {\n    margin: 10px 0 0 78px;\n  }\n  .entry {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .headline {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #1f3d6e;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .num { color: #1f3d6e; }\n  .word { margin-left: 14px; }\n  .pron { margin-left: 16px; font-weight: bold; }\n  .pron .flag { margin-right: 6px; }\n  .def {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #1f3d6e;\n    line-height: 2;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .example {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #1f3d6e;\n    line-height: 2;\n  }\n  .cn {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #1f3d6e;\n    line-height: 2;\n  }\n  .indent { margin-left: 16px; }\n  .hl-pink { background: #f6c3ae; }\n  .hl-yellow { background: #fdf3a8; }\n  .hl-blue { background: #bcd7ef; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"masthead\"><span class=\"china\">CHINA</span><span class=\"daily\">DAILY</span></div>\n  <div class=\"logo-row\">\n    <span class=\"logo-cn\">中国日报</span>\n    <span class=\"logo-url\">| www.chinadaily.com.cn</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"passage\">\n    <div class=\"col-en\">\n      began to get a little less dark in 1477, when Archduke Maximilian of Austria <span class=\"kw\">commissioned[5]</span> an extravagant diamond ring for his new wife. The <span class=\"kw\">accessory[6]</span> grew in popularity in the Victorian era, and gradually the diamond ring trend <span class=\"kw\">trickled down[7]</span> from nobility to the masses.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-cn\">\n      米兰至公给新婚妻子定制了一枚奢侈的钻石戒指，自那以后订婚戒指的含义就没那么阴暗了。订婚戒指在维多利亚时代变得越发流行，订婚钻戒的习俗也从贵族流传到了民间。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"entries\">\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"headline\"><span class=\"num\">[1]</span><span class=\"word\">twisted</span><span class=\"pron\"><span class=\"flag\">美</span>/ˈtwɪstɪd/</span></div>\n      <div class=\"def\">adj. mentally or emotionally unsound or disturbed &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;扭曲的</div>\n      <div class=\"example\">She gave a small twisted smile. &nbsp;她不不自然地微微一笑。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"headline\"><span class=\"num\">[2]</span><span class=\"word\">gem</span><span class=\"pron\"><span class=\"flag\">美</span>/dʒem/</span></div>\n      <div class=\"def\">n. (also gemstone) a precious stone that has been cut and polished and is used in jewellery（经切割打磨的）宝石</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"headline\"><span class=\"num\">[3]</span><span class=\"word\">anthropologist</span><span class=\"pron\"><span class=\"flag\">美</span>/ˌænθrəˈpɑːlədʒɪst/ &nbsp;&nbsp;n. 人类学家</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"headline\"><span class=\"num\">[4]</span><span class=\"hl-pink\"><span class=\"word\">date back to... /date from...</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;追溯到；始于；自…至今</span></div>\n      <div class=\"example indent\">The college dates back to medieval times.</div>\n      <div class=\"cn indent\">这所学院创办于中世纪。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"headline\"><span class=\"num\">[5]</span><span class=\"hl-yellow\"><span class=\"word\">commission</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;熟词僻义</span></div>\n      <div class=\"def\"><span class=\"hl-yellow\">v. to officially ask sb to write, make or create sth or to do a task for you &nbsp;正式委托（谱写或制作、创作、完成）</span></div>\n      <div class=\"example\">Publishers have commissioned a French translation of the book.</div>\n      <div class=\"cn\">出版商已委托人把这本书译成法语。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"headline\"><span class=\"num\">[6]</span><span class=\"word\">accessory</span><span class=\"pron\"><span class=\"flag\">美</span>/əkˈsesəri/</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
